ITEM B49 — Resolution of the Feature-Index Primary Key
------------------------------------------------------
1. Feature Counts per File: Raw vs In-Domain Retained:
   - ga.geojson:
     * Raw Feature Count in GeoJSON: 402 features
     * In-Domain Retained Count: 402 features (100% inside domain)
   - ka.geojson:
