   - What B46 Reported: B46 reported the IN-DOMAIN RETAINED counts, but erroneously labelled them as total file counts.
2. Semantics of feature_index:
   - feature_index is the 0-based RAW FEATURE POSITION within the original state GeoJSON file, NOT a post-filter position.
   - That is why indices exceed the retained count:
     * mh1.geojson:24119 is the 24,119th feature of the 25,000 raw features in mh1.geojson.
     * ka.geojson:21888 (Muduba) is the 21,888th feature of the 29,731 raw features in ka.geojson.
     * ka.geojson:21692 (Dattathreyapeeta) is the 21,692nd feature in ka.geojson.
     * mh2.geojson:10694 (Nagave) is the 10,694th feature of the 23,926 raw features in mh2.geojson.
